WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.646
Mom and Dad were busy getting ready for the trip.

2
00:00:06.647 --> 00:00:08.949
Hana: What are you doing, Mom?

3
00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:11.530
Mom: I'm wrapping some

4
00:00:11.531 --> 00:00:13.345
gifts. Hana: Who are they

5
00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:16.774
for? Mom: They are for

6
00:00:16.775 --> 00:00:18.554
Grandma. Hana: Can I help

7
00:00:18.555 --> 00:00:20.096
you? Mom: Sure, you

8
00:00:20.097 --> 00:00:22.140
can. Bring me the ribbon.

9
00:00:22.141 --> 00:00:25.821
Hana: Here you go.

10
00:00:25.822 --> 00:00:30.899
Mom: Thanks. By the way, have you tried on your party

11
00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:34.217
dress? Hana: I did. It still fits me

12
00:00:34.218 --> 00:00:36.009
well. Should I put it on?

13
00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:40.976
Mom: Yes. I would like to see it just in case.

14
00:00:40.977 --> 00:00:42.600
Hana: How do I look?

15
00:00:42.601 --> 00:00:45.367
Mom: Oh, you look so

16
00:00:45.368 --> 00:00:49.928
wonderful. Take it off now, and save it for the party.

17
00:00:49.929 --> 00:00:52.544
Hana: What about Bada and Hada?

18
00:00:52.545 --> 00:00:55.255
Mom: I have to buy a new suit for Bada.

19
00:00:55.256 --> 00:00:59.196
Hada can wear Bada's old one. Do

20
00:00:59.197 --> 00:01:01.990
you have fancy party clothes?

21
00:01:01.991 --> 00:01:04.697
I love the color of mine.

22
00:01:04.698 --> 00:01:09.992
I can't wait to see Bada and Hada wearing their suits.

